1107=About
1108=<html><body style="font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:9pt;margin:0;padding:0;color:#222;line-height:1.45;"><b>Sticky Notes Mirror</b> is a free desktop companion for Microsoft Sticky Notes that adds remote synchronization, workstation routing, note recovery, and database-backed storage.<br><br><b>What the program does</b><br>- works with the original Microsoft Sticky Notes database<br>- keeps notes synchronized with one selected remote backend<br>- supports Firebird and MariaDB / MySQL<br>- lets you browse all notes, restore deleted notes, and route notes to specific PCs<br><br><b>Advantages over the standard Sticky Notes app</b><br>- central storage in a server database<br>- two-way synchronization between the local notes database and the selected server backend<br>- note visibility control for different workstations<br>- local workstation aliases for easier routing<br>- deleted note recovery<br>- additional formatting and management tools<br><br><b>Project</b><br><a href="https://github.com/stickynotesmirror-png/StickyNotesMirror.git">https://github.com/stickynotesmirror-png/StickyNotesMirror.git</a><br><br><b>License</b><br>This program is completely free to use.<br><br><b>Contact</b><br><a href="mailto:stickynotesmirror@gmail.com">stickynotesmirror@gmail.com</a></body></html>
